Cell[TextData[{
 "Field elements are always printed in black and has additional string \
marker. In this case \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Quaternion\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. Clifford algebra \
elements that are not fields are always printed in color, which is provided \
by ",
